# Cloudflare Pages redirects/proxies
# This deployment publishes the repo ROOT (assets at /index.html, /icons/, ...).

# 1) Proxy all /api/* requests to the Render backend.
#    200 = proxy rewrite; the browser stays on your Pages domain (no CORS).
#    TODO: replace <YOUR-RENDER-URL> with your deployed Render service URL.
/api/* https://<YOUR-RENDER-URL>/api/:splat 200

# 2) SPA fallback: any unknown path serves the shell (index.html).
/* /index.html 200